                <pb facs="0278" n="268" sameAs="frus:frus1943China/pg268"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">761.93/1720: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Chargé in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Atcheson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-06-29T15:00:00-04:00">June 29, 1943—3
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>823. Reference Moscow’s telegram no. 663, June 15, 10 a.m. (which was repeated to
                    you) quoting Vladivostok’s telegram no. 65, June 11, 11 a.m.</p>
                <p>The Department would like to have any information you have or may be able to
                    obtain on this subject.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
